{"id":"a55351eb48f8bd69","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-algebraizable.md","title":"Algebraizable Logic","display":"df-algebraizable — Algebraizable Logic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-algebraizable","aliases":["93-df-algebraizable"],"display":"df-algebraizable — Algebraizable Logic","depends_on":["[[93-df-finite-subset]]","[[93-df-logic]]","[[93-df-consequence]]","[[93-df-formula]]","[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-model]]","[[93-df-quasivariety]]","[[93-df-equational-class]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-algebraizable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-algebraizable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraizable — Algebraizable Logic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b63f2f43b5511ee\" href=\"?note=6b63f2f43b5511ee\" title=\"93-df-finite-subset\">93-df-finite-subset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bd7e4207897c8db3\" href=\"?note=bd7e4207897c8db3\" title=\"93-df-logic\">93-df-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"afd7605d365be7b6\" href=\"?note=afd7605d365be7b6\" title=\"93-df-consequence\">93-df-consequence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c2ca1af9af149e69\" href=\"?note=c2ca1af9af149e69\" title=\"93-df-formula\">93-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"55094a403a51c25e\" href=\"?note=55094a403a51c25e\" title=\"93-df-equational-class\">93-df-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L\">\\(\\mathcal L\\)</span> is a propositional-logic candidate and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span> is its explicitly supplied connective/algebraic similarity type; the formula carrier is bound inside the definition.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}\\)</span> are the sourced type-indexed logic, similarity-type, and quasivariety predicates.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> is the sourced equation set; equational consequence <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau}\\)</span>, setwise extensions of the two finite translations, and mutual derivability with a formula set are defined below.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>The bold symbols <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\tau\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\tau\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\rho\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\rho\\)</span> denote translations, not the similarity type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathcal L}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgLog}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgLog}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>翻译的集合延拓只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq F\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol\\rho:\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\to[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\boldsymbol\\rho:\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\to[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\">\\(E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\)</span> 定义；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimType}_{93}(\\tau)\\)</span>。此处的两类翻译是下面主定义中相应函数的实例，不另选隐藏翻译。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraizable}\\vdash E\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau}D\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathbf K,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathbf K\\;\\Bigl[(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in E\\;\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\forall\\delta\\in D\\;\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\delta\\Bigr]\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Gamma]\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\gamma),\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\rho[E]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varepsilon\\in E}\\boldsymbol\\rho(\\varepsilon),\\\\\n\\varphi\\dashv\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land\\Delta\\subseteq F\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\Delta\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Delta\\;(\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraizable}\\vdash E\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau}D\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathbf K,\\tau)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land E,D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathbf K\\;\\Bigl[(\\forall\\varepsilon\\in E\\;\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\varepsilon)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\to\\forall\\delta\\in D\\;\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}\\delta\\Bigr]\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Gamma]\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\bigcup_{\\gamma\\in\\Gamma}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\gamma),\\qquad\\boldsymbol\\rho[E]\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{\\varepsilon\\in E}\\boldsymbol\\rho(\\varepsilon),\\\\\n\\varphi\\dashv\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\Delta\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\varphi\\in F\\land\\Delta\\subseteq F\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{8em}\\land\\Delta\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\n\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\Delta\\;(\\{\\varphi\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\psi)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraizable}\\vdash\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau_{\\mathcal L}=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land F=T_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathbf K,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\exists\\boldsymbol\\tau\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\rho:\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\to[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Gamma]\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n(\\varphi\\dashv\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\boldsymbol\\rho[\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\varphi)])\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;(\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\boldsymbol\\rho(\\varepsilon)])\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraizable}\\vdash\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\exists F\\;\\exists\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau_{\\mathcal L}=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land F=T_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\n\\land\\mathcal L=\\langle F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{Logic}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(F,\\vdash_{\\mathcal L})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathbf K,\\tau_{\\mathcal L})\n\\land\\exists\\boldsymbol\\tau\\;\\exists\\boldsymbol\\rho\\;\\Bigl[\n\\boldsymbol\\tau:F\\to[\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})]^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\boldsymbol\\rho:\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\to[F]^{&lt;\\omega}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n(\\Gamma\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\Gamma]\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\varphi))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in F\\;\n(\\varphi\\dashv\\vdash_{\\mathcal L}\\boldsymbol\\rho[\\boldsymbol\\tau(\\varphi)])\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;(\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\mathbf K;\\tau_{\\mathcal L}}\\boldsymbol\\tau[\\boldsymbol\\rho(\\varepsilon)])\\Bigr]\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraizable}\\vdash\\mathcal L\\in\\mathrm{AlgLog}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\exists\\mathbf K\\;\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}algebraizable}\\vdash\\mathcal L\\in\\mathrm{AlgLog}\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau\\;\\exists\\mathbf K\\;\\mathrm{Algz}_{93}(\\mathcal L,\\mathbf K;\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本文件保留原有全称恒等式后承：每个前提等式先在整个代数的所有赋值下成立，再检验结论恒等式；并未替换为同一赋值下的条件等式后承。两种翻译的集合延拓均为像集之并，第三个翻译条件仍只有原来的一个方向。这里不额外断言其等同于文献中的其他可代数化定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"i